  "changes": [
    "EventStoreAgentCommandDispatcher binds the admitted intent to the exact submitted intent: logical MessageId, target, operation, actor, correlation/causation, bytes and original metadata must be unchanged; only non-blank trust:* entries may be added; otherwise DependencyNotAvailable(EXT-HOST-1) before any target command.",
    "AgentsTrustedCommandExtensionPolicy claims trust:* host metadata for the commands it governs and accepts it only with the existing Dapr identity, admitted proof and a non-blank value; the delivery nonce stays outside AD-29 idempotency.",
    "TrustedEnvelopeReplayAggregate validates first-seen times only on first registration; an exact later delivery is a no-op regardless of verifier-local time.",
    "SecurityEventLogAggregate accepts only a derived lowercase SHA-256 SecurityObservationId (optionally security-observation- prefixed).",
    "ProjectedTenantAccessReader: the actor latest (actor, role) assignment decides, so a revocation or re-grant naming another Party revokes; Agents.Approver/AuditOperator/Operator history is valid while unknown roles still block.",
    "ApproverPolicyVerdict.EvaluateAction: edit, regeneration, approval, rejection and abandonment authorize the acting human against the union of sources; unavailable/unknown/substituted/ambiguous sources still fail closed.",
    "EventStoreProviderCatalogOperations command-outcome lookup answers a foreign-tenant/message status exactly like an absent one.",
    "TenantProviderEnablementReadModel.IsScopedTo: reader, tenant list/detail, platform tenant inspection and catalog queries return content-free Unavailable for a misrouted tenant enablement model before freshness reads or rendering.",
    "eng/verify-story-5.4.ps1 additionally requires AgentApproverPolicyTests and UI ApproverPolicyTests to execute and pass."
  ],
